cartridge "INCENDIE/JEAN-FRANCOIS SEHAN/1984"

' INCENDIE - ColecoVision version of the Oric game by Jean-Francois Sehan
' ("L'Oric a l'affiche", Editions du P.S.I., 1984). Reimagined by Amy &
' Claude, Amy Studio 2026. Built by build.py from this file,
' ../_common/amy/core.alexis, pages.txt, art.py and music/*.txt.
'
' THE GAME (as in the book): a house is on fire. People jump from it, one
' after the other; two firefighters move a stretcher (the book's "drap")
' left and right under them. Each jumper bounces three times on it, at
' three fixed places, then lands in the ambulance: one point. A jumper that
' reaches the ground without the stretcher under him costs one of the three
' lives. Every 50 points: one more life. Each round has N people to save
' (1, 2, 3 ... up to 10 in the book); when all are in the ambulance, N
' grows by one. The book's path (DATA 1060-1070) has 14 places: the balcony,
' 3 x (down to the stretcher, up again), then the ambulance.
'
' CONTROLS: joystick left / right moves the stretcher one place (hold to
' keep sliding). Title: up / down, a button confirms.
'
' LIBERTIES (listed for Amy):
' - Smooth flight: each jump is a parabola (fast near the stretcher, slow at
'   the top) instead of the book's 14 character places; the three catch
'   places, the balcony and the ambulance keep the book's order.
' - The stretcher slides to its next place in 8 frames (G&W-like steps).
' - A jumper is caught if the stretcher is under him when he reaches it, or
'   arrives in the next few frames (a little grace, he sinks a few pixels).
' - Missed jumpers are not hurt: a cartoon bump, dizzy stars, then they walk
'   to the ambulance on their own. It still costs a life (a helmet).
' - FAIR JUMPS (measured with tests/bot.mjs): a person waiting on the
'   balcony only jumps when none of his three bounces would need the
'   stretcher somewhere else less than 24 frames (one place away) or 32
'   frames (two places away) before or after another jumper's bounce.
' - Rounds: level n has n+2 people (at most 10) and a faster jump.
' - Colour, animation, music and sound effects are new. The book's PING on
'   a save and SHOOT on a miss became the "ding" and the "bonk".

